v0.4.16 — OpenCode v2 servers are now supported

• Works with the new OpenCode v2 server API; v1 servers (opencode 1.x) keep working too — no upgrade required.
• Fixed messages lost when switching project directories.
• Fixed connections through some tunnels (ngrok, Cloudflare).
• New "Select text" on any message: full-screen view to select and copy text.
